    {
      "name": "Landing Aurora · Full page",
      "category": "Landing pages",
      "description": "Demo landing in pure Tailwind + theme tokens. Five sections, no nav/footer (chrome-shell). Import then Apply → replace or append.",
      "html": "<section class=\"voodbuilder-editor-section relative overflow-hidden bg-vp-bg-alt py-24 text-vp-text-2\" data-voodbuilder-section-block=\"vb-demo-aurora-hero\">\n  <div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <div class=\"absolute -left-24 top-10 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-vp-brand-1/20 blur-3xl\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute -right-16 bottom-0 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-vp-brand-2/15 blur-3xl\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"voodbuilder-editor-container relative z-10 w-full px-5\" data-voodbuilder-role=\"content\" data-voodbuilder-content-width=\"normal\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-8 text-center\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"copy\">\n      <p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-vp-brand-1\">VoodBuilder · Landing demo</p>\n      <h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-vp-text-1 sm:text-6xl\">Ship Laravel landings with pure Tailwind sections</h1>\n      <p class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">A page template split into reusable pieces: hero, features, metrics, steps and CTA. Import the JSON, apply or append sections, then let page JIT compile the utilities.</p>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"actions\">\n        <a href=\"#features\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-vp-brand-1 px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-vp-brand-2\" data-voodbuilder-cta=\"true\">Explore features</a>\n        <a href=\"#cta\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-vp-divider bg-vp-bg-elv px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-vp-text-1 transition hover:bg-vp-bg\" data-voodbuilder-cta=\"true\">Get started</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"features\" class=\"voodbuilder-editor-section bg-vp-bg py-20 text-vp-text-2\" data-voodbuilder-section-block=\"vb-demo-aurora-features\">\n  <div class=\"voodbuilder-editor-container w-full px-5\" data-voodbuilder-role=\"content\" data-voodbuilder-content-width=\"normal\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto mb-14 max-w-2xl space-y-3 text-center\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"copy\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-vp-text-1 sm:text-4xl\">Built as composable pieces</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Each section is a self-contained Tailwind block. Use the full landing, or append single pieces from the same import bundle.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\">\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-8 ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <p class=\"mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-vp-brand-1\">Editor</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Visual canvas</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Drop sections, edit copy, and keep theme tokens in sync with light and dark.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-8 ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <p class=\"mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-vp-brand-1\">Tailwind</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Utilities only</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">No custom BEM sheets — page JIT compiles classes on apply and on save.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-8 ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <p class=\"mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-vp-brand-1\">Import</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">One JSON file</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Full page plus per-section templates share the same <code class=\"text-vp-text-1\">voodbuilder-page-templates</code> format.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"voodbuilder-editor-section border-y border-vp-divider bg-vp-bg-alt py-16 text-vp-text-2\" data-voodbuilder-section-block=\"vb-demo-aurora-stats\">\n  <div class=\"voodbuilder-editor-container w-full px-5\" data-voodbuilder-role=\"content\" data-voodbuilder-content-width=\"normal\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"grid gap-8 text-center sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-vp-brand-1\">5</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-vp-text-3\">Sections in this kit</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-vp-brand-1\">0</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-vp-text-3\">Custom CSS required</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-vp-brand-1\">1</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-vp-text-3\">JSON import file</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-vp-brand-1\">JIT</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-vp-text-3\">Canvas compile on apply</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"voodbuilder-editor-section bg-vp-bg py-20 text-vp-text-2\" data-voodbuilder-section-block=\"vb-demo-aurora-steps\">\n  <div class=\"voodbuilder-editor-container w-full px-5\" data-voodbuilder-role=\"content\" data-voodbuilder-content-width=\"normal\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"grid items-start gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2\">\n      <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"copy\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-vp-text-1\">From JSON to published page</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Import the bundle under Templates, then choose replace or append when the page already has content.</p>\n      </div>\n      <ol class=\"space-y-5\">\n        <li class=\"flex gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-vp-brand-1 text-xs font-bold text-white\">1</span>\n          <span class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\"><strong class=\"text-vp-text-1\">Import</strong> the JSON in the Templates sidebar.</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"flex gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-vp-brand-1 text-xs font-bold text-white\">2</span>\n          <span class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\"><strong class=\"text-vp-text-1\">Apply</strong> the full landing, or append a single section template.</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"flex gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-vp-brand-1 text-xs font-bold text-white\">3</span>\n          <span class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\"><strong class=\"text-vp-text-1\">Edit</strong> copy and CTAs on the canvas — Tailwind utilities stay theme-aware.</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"flex gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-vp-brand-1 text-xs font-bold text-white\">4</span>\n          <span class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\"><strong class=\"text-vp-text-1\">Save</strong> to publish — server recompiles page CSS for visitors.</span>\n        </li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"cta\" class=\"voodbuilder-editor-section relative overflow-hidden bg-vp-brand-1 py-20 text-white\" data-voodbuilder-section-block=\"vb-demo-aurora-cta\">\n  <div class=\"voodbuilder-editor-container relative z-10 w-full px-5\" data-voodbuilder-role=\"content\" data-voodbuilder-content-width=\"normal\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-center\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"copy\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl\">Ready to try the import?</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-white/80\">Apply this landing on an empty page, or append the CTA section under existing content to verify replace vs append.</p>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"actions\">\n        <a href=\"https://voodflow.com\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-vp-bg-elv px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-vp-brand-1 transition hover:bg-vp-bg\" data-voodbuilder-cta=\"true\">Open Voodflow</a>\n        <a href=\"#features\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/30 px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-white/10\" data-voodbuilder-cta=\"true\">Back to features</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
